      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please know that the profound quiet you're feeling is a massive, echoing void where his presence used to be, and that is a terribly painful place to be. It makes perfect sense that you feel lost and like a ghost right now; you are navigating the sudden erasure of your entire routine. Allow yourself the grace to feel completely adrift; there is no \"right\" way to feel in this moment. If you can manage it, even small acts like making a cup of tea or stepping outside for a minute can be a tiny anchor in this overwhelming silence.",
